      "en": "You believe that God is one. You do well. The demons also believe—and shudder.",
      "ko": "네가 하나님은 한 분이신 줄을 믿느냐 잘하는도다 귀신들도 믿고 떠느니라",
      "source_text_hash": "241510c3522bc479c76e79a605d0dd50520edec22a844fc974ef7399d1445551",
      "translation_text_hash": "b08bc08d23c0883c857b2e89d0cb40299307a8885ed9c24e8729222920331f03",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "네가 하나님은 한 분이신 줄을 믿느냐 잘하는도다 귀신들도 믿고 떠느니라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "b08bc08d23c0883c857b2e89d0cb40299307a8885ed9c24e8729222920331f03"
      ]
    },
